config BR2_PACKAGE_FLUIDD
	bool "fluidd (Klipper web UI)"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_MOONRAKER
	help
	  Fluidd is a single-page-app web frontend for Klipper/Moonraker.
	  Installs the static files (HTML/JS/CSS) to /var/www/fluidd.
	  Needs an HTTP server (e.g. nginx or lighttpd) to actually serve
	  the files — the nginx config in our rootfs overlay does this.

	  See: https://docs.fluidd.xyz/

comment "fluidd requires moonraker"
	depends on !BR2_PACKAGE_MOONRAKER
